---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About · unbeholden.dev">
	<section class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-[clamp(24px,5vw,72px)] gap-y-12">
		<div class="min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[480px] sm:max-w-[620px] text-[19px] leading-[1.8]">
			<p class="meta mb-[clamp(28px,4vw,44px)] tracking-[0.18em]">About</p>
			<p>
				I'm Jakub. I keep my own data and run open source where there is a version worth running. I
				have never had a good answer to why I would hand a company my photos and my mail when I do
				not have to. Convenience is the honest answer, and doing it myself has cost less than I
				assumed.
			</p>
			<p class="text-dim mt-[26px]">
				This runs on hardware I own and a VPS I pay for. I do keep analytics, because I would rather
				know which posts were worth writing, but it is Umami on my own box: no cookies, and nothing
				about you leaves it.
			</p>
			<p class="text-dim mt-[26px]">
				When the thing I need doesn't exist, or exists only as a service someone else can withdraw, I
				write it and publish it here. Usually small, usually specific to one problem.
			</p>
			<p class="text-dim mt-[26px]">Prose is CC BY 4.0. Code is CC0/MIT.</p>
		</div>
		<div
			class="text-dim flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[260px] flex-col gap-4 font-mono text-[12px] leading-[1.9] tracking-[0.05em] sm:max-w-[240px]"
		>
			<a href="mailto:hello@unbeholden.dev"
				>Email<br /><span class="text-faint">hello@unbeholden.dev</span></a
			>
			<a href="/feed.xml" class="text-accent"
				>RSS<br /><span class="text-faint">unbeholden.dev/feed.xml</span></a
			>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
